WEBVTT

00:46:57.606 --> 00:47:00.315
about our connections
to the sorrows of the world

00:47:00.339 --> 00:47:02.300
and our sense of longing.

00:47:03.295 --> 00:47:06.103
If you know an introvert or an extrovert

00:47:06.127 --> 00:47:09.094
who you think might be interested
in some of Susan’s ideas,

00:47:09.118 --> 00:47:12.510
why not share this episode with them?

00:47:12.534 --> 00:47:15.518
If you like the show,
please rate us on iTunes.

00:47:15.542 --> 00:47:17.682
We love to hear your thoughts.

00:47:19.210 --> 00:47:22.690
This week’s show
was produced by Megan Tan.

00:47:22.714 --> 00:47:25.305
Our production manager
is Roxanne Hai Lash,

00:47:25.329 --> 00:47:27.380
our mix engineer, David Herman.

00:47:27.404 --> 00:47:30.464
Our theme music
is by Allison Layton-Brown.